WEBVTT

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.650
Should we only worry about having fun?

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.940
It's okay.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.900
We, as Master Roots, are already doing our job by being here.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:20.910
We were able to produce such a large number of Master Roots so quickly, all thanks to you.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:25.920
I simply did my best in carrying out the project.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:31.300
Eventually, we'll need the Master Roots to form contracts with the Mototsumitama.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.680
Kuraki, want to make a contract with me?

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.930
Someone such as myself is unsuitable.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:57.200
Kuro...

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:01.160
Wait for me. I'll be there soon.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:13.920
Keita-kun?

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.470
Kuro-chan?

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.550
"The End"

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.470
Wh-What happened?

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.770
Makana-chan, what happened?!

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:30.440
Hiyou, let me go!

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.400
Scared?

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.160
Kuro-sama, your sweat tastes like sweet nectar.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:53.340
There's a limit to how stubborn you can be, Kuro-sama!

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:01.850
This isn't the pure land.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.520
The guards who protect you,

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.270
Reishin-sama and even the Maiden, aren't here.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.730
It's only you and me.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.690
Just the two of us...

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:20.030
Let's have fun together, Princess.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.700
If you want to have fun...

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.120
Please have it by yourself!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.540
Kuro!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.300
Kuro, let's escape!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.300
Keita-san!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.300
Crap!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.680
Kuro!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.060
Move aside!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.410
Akane-chan, did you manage to get in contact with Keita?

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.280
No.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.200
Kuro-chan is missing, too.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.660
Just what is going on?

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.590
Are you okay?

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.930
I have to go and save Kakuma.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.100
Wait!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.770
Where did she go?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.820
I'll search for her in that direction.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.360
Okay.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.530
Kakuma...

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.210
This is...

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.960
What is going on?!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:24.660
You're...

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.910
the one from—!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.410
Are you aiming for the Reiseki again?!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.210
Interrogating me for the information concerning the key to the sacred precincts is futile!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.920
You suddenly came in and killed Father and the rest, and they didn't have the time to tell me about it!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.300
Serves you right!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.930
Looks like you really don't know anything.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:54.850
I already have the key.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.940
You're lying!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.480
The key to the sacred precincts...

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.940
is you.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.700
I understand.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.240
I'll go and pick up the guest.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.450
You search for the other two.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.330
Roger.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.710
What happened here?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.090
Hiyou!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.570
I don't have a chance to use the Megaexe.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:59.250
If this continues, I'm going to collapse first.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.340
If I could create a chance for Kuro to use her Exceed...

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.220
Can I use it?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.230
How long do you intend to mess around?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:23.230
Although it was by accident, I did manage to activate it once.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.150
Remember what I felt then...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.490
Come on! Come on!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.240
Come on!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.250
Hiyou!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.840
How unfortunate.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.090
Keita-san!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.720
Kuro-sama, I'm your opponent.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:55.760
Shinobu.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.310
I know.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.230
Hiyou's

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.520
contractee?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.780
Surprised?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.280
That flow of Tera is...

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:15.780
Kuro-sama, this is the first time you've seen me synchro, right?

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.790
The first time seeing my Exceed, too.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.050
What?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.220
Exceed, Maryuu Touda!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.310
I've no choice but to bet everything on Megaexe!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.860
The synchro is...

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:53.360
My Exceed is interesting, isn't it?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.700
Come, let me make this more fun for you!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.800
I like the way you glare at me.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.180
Keita-san!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.560
What is she doing?!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.640
Shinobu is draining his Tera away.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.650
Draining... Tera?

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.400
A human draining another human's Tera?!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.820
She isn't a Master Root,

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.650
but a Minus Root.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.530
Minus Root?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:44.250
The Doppeliner system distributes luck between three persons: a Root and two Subs.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.880
According to it, when the Root encounters the two Subs,

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.290
they will die, and the Root will absorb their Tera.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:54.050
From this, the Root will become a Master Root and gain a great deal of luck.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.890
However, can you twist the system.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.060
If you artificially make a Sub the last one to survive,

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.890
the Tera absorbed by the Sub will turn into a negative power,

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:07.520
turning them into a Minus Root.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.020
Minus Root...

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.690
Then, you were originally a...

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.690
I was a Sub like you.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:19.950
I was reborn as a Minus Root after I killed off the Root.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.200
Killed off the Root...

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:48.690
I learned that I was able to escape the fate of being a Sub once I'd killed the Root.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:54.320
Hiyou told me that he'd look for my Root once I made a contract with him.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:59.160
I lived every day fearing that I'd be drained of Tera during synchro.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.530
I finally found my Root.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.790
Finally.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.800
You killed my mother...

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.680
That's right. I killed her

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.890
so that I could become a Minus Root!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.700
I couldn't find her anywhere. Where are Keita-kun and Kuro?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.910
They haven't returned.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.620
It might be better for us to contact the police.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.970
You're Sano Akane-san, right?

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.840
I'm Kuraki from the Kaionji Group.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.850
Kaionji?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.310
We're here to retrieve you.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.100
Don't worry.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.360
Ibuki-kun is there, too.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:23.110
I was reborn by the mere fact that a Sub killed a Root.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:27.370
I became someone who can drain away Tera and luck!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.120
How dare you kill my mother...

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.460
Not happy about it?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:40.880
A Minus Root can drain Tera from others to replenish the Tera consumed during synchro.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.800
In other words, it's an immortal contractee.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.890
Convenient, no?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:50.640
How dare you kill Keita's mother for a selfish reason like that!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.100
It's pointless.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.020
What can Kuro-sama do when she can't even synchro?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:00.650
Now, let's ignore that ape and have fun.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:09.580
My Exceed, Maryuu Touda, is able to control and change the state of water.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.830
That is why things like solidifying and then shattering bodily fluids

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.710
are within my power.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:22.170
Isn't my Exceed wonderful?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.970
Let's have a lot of fun!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.850
Kuro...

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:37.690
You're able to change your own fate as long as you aren't afraid to stain your hands.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:43.240
Since I was a child, I've never experienced anything nice.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:13:02.130
It was confounding to think that I couldn't obtain even the slightest fragment of happiness.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.050
Want to change you fate?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.220
I was shocked after hearing about the Doppeliner system.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:16.810
There are people who look like me, yet they're leading happy lives.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:21.980
If I were to die, they'd absorb my Tera and become even luckier.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.490
I couldn't allow that!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.160
In that case, I just needed to snatch away that luck and Tera!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.500
I wanted to try to change the fate I was born with!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.670
Hey, you're a Sub too, so you understand, right?

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:43.210
If he appeared before you, you'd kill your Root too, wouldn't you?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:47.430
I'll let you live if you agree.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:53.010
I'm willing to ask Hiyou to turn you into a Minus Root as well.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:58.060
Change your fate with your own hands, and obtain happiness!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.980
Are you really satisfied with that?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.280
Did you become happy?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.700
Of course!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:13.030
I obtained Tera and luck, and was able to live on!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.410
To me...

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.750
What is it?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.290
You don't seem happy at all!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.640
You understand, don't you?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.550
This isn't true happiness.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.060
Shut up!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:38.060
I was finally able to obtain happiness!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.310
I don't want that kind of happiness!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:47.070
Shut up, you brat!

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.330
Kuro, time for synchro!

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.470
You really amuse me, Kuro-sama.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.320
Synchro!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.410
What do you intend to do with that tiny amount of Tera you have?

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.710
Even if you synchro, what difference does it make?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:49.380
Subs can struggle all they want, but it all amounts to nothing.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:59.350
You won't know unless you try!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:05.900
If you didn't exist, she wouldn't have become something repulsive like a Minus Root,

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:10.110
and Keita's mother wouldn't have died for her, either!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:16.200
What are you capable of when you can't even use an Exceed?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.990
Come at me, Kuro-sama!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:23.670
Someone lost a person dear to him because of your selfishness,

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.380
and I'll make you taste that pain!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:31.300
Being able to experience the last, precious bit of Tera that Kuro-sama wills out...

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.050
I am honored!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.430
Go!

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:43.810
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:10.880
Keita-san, are you okay?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.340
How did you provide the Tera?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:18.390
I tried to focus what little Tera I had into a point and send it to you.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.470
It worked out well.

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.810
When did you learn to do that?

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:29.270
When I was using the Thousands, I sensed that I was able to control a certain amount of Tera.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.190
Keita-san...

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:42.540
Am I dying?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.120
I don't want to die...

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.840
I'm not happy yet...

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.840
Because I'm a Sub...

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:59.470
In the end, even though I tried my best, I can't attain happiness after all?

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.430
I'm not an evil person.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.730
I just want to be happy.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.860
Happiness...

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:31.080
Is becoming a Minus Root... the only way for a Sub to survive?

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.090
If I were to refuse that path, then when death confronts me,

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.420
I'll...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.350
Why?

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.150
Why must the Doppeliner system exist?

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:04.950
More... Have more fun with me...

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.160
Kuro-sama...

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.790
It's been a while.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.550
I'm here to retrieve you, Ibuki.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.220
Have you forgotten what your buddy looks like?

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:30.560
Sano-san is already heading toward my cottage.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.560
Sawamura?

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.240
Keita-san!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:44.620
Keita-san, are you okay?!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:46.200
This is the first frame of the ED

00:19:53.250 --> 00:20:04.340
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:20:04.340
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:15.770
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:15.770
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:28.160
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:28.160
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:44.550
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:44.550
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.680
Where am I?

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:55.190
You've contributed a lot, Hiyou.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.270
What is going on?

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.940
You bastard, don't tell me you intend to drain my Tera away?!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.690
Think an ape like you is able to use it?

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.700
Who are you?!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.700
He's my Mototsumitama.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.200
What?!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.160
Kuraki, wait!

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.210
Stop this.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:20.170
The Tera of a noble Mototsumitama like you

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:22.300
"Reunion"

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.710
shall be used by us lowly apes.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.840
Stop this!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.260
No, please stop!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.720
Please stop!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.470
Don't drain my Tera away!

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:39.230
I told you not to drain it!
